          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum tic migi en e kuro wot Harun kum timotim mi ot pa Yehova, i lelagang’, man i kusika, man i dwokrileng’ mi gin ma leng’ ceke, cil tic mi timotim mi ot pa Mungu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mi kwen m’anyutha bende, man mi mogo ma yom pi girathiera mi mogo, kadok mi kwen m’apada ma thobi mbe i ie, kadi mi gin ma jutedo i atangla, kadi mi gin ma juyomo i pi, man mi mukero ku jambpor ceke ma kwonde tung’ tung’; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kara gicung ku ba rupiny ku ba rupiny gifoi gipak Yehova, man kud uthieno kumeca; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kara githier lam m’awang’a ceke ni Yehova, i ceng’ sabatu, man i dwi m’upor, man i agba ma juketho, i wel calku lembapoka ma pigi, thiri thiri i wang’ Yehova: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man kara gigwok lembang’ola mi hema mi cokri, man lembang’ola mi kamaleng’, man lembang’ola mi wot Harun ma utumeggi, pi timotim mi ot pa Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
